  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"float:right;max-width: 35%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><b>Cost</b></td>\n<td>$2,850, 200x <a href=\"/index.php/Steel\" title=\"Steel\">steel</a>, 2,000x <a href=\"/index.php/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">wood</a>, 10x <a href=\"/index.php/Silicon\" title=\"Silicon\">silicon</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Total Cost</b></td>\n<td>$5000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Inputs</b></td>\n<td>2x <a href=\"/index.php/Silicon\" title=\"Silicon\">silicon</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Outputs</b></td>\n<td>40x <a href=\"/index.php/LED\" title=\"LED\">LED</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Production interval</b></td>\n<td>50 seconds\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Production/Min</b></td>\n<td>48x <a href=\"/index.php/LED\" title=\"LED\">LED</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Profit/Min</b></td>\n<td>$96.00\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Profit/Hour</b></td>\n<td>$5760.00\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Return On Investment</b></td>\n<td>0.72%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Aliases</b></td>\n<td>led factory, ledfactory, led fac\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The LED factory is a facility that produces 40x <a href=\"/index.php/LED\" title=\"LED\">LED</a> every 50 seconds.\n</p><p>You need 2x <a href=\"/index.php/Silicon_mine\" title=\"Silicon mine\">Silicon mine</a> to maintain this factory.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_facilities\">Related facilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=LED_factory&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Related facilities\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><b>As input</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Lamp_factory\" title=\"Lamp factory\">Lamp factory</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261009055244\nCache expiry: 86400\nDynamic content: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.003 seconds\nPreprocessor visit